# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SoccerSentimentTracker configuration
#
# Nothing here is required to run the project. With an empty .env the tracker
# still collects from ~15 public Dutch news/football RSS feeds, which need no
# authentication at all. Each block below switches on an extra collector.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Where the SQLite file lives.
DB_PATH=./data/sentiment.db

# HTTP port for the dashboard + API.
PORT=8787

# Polite crawling. Keep the contact address real — several Dutch sites tarpit
# anonymous scrapers but happily serve an identified one.
USER_AGENT=SoccerSentimentTracker/0.1 (+https://github.com/bfmwijnen-tb/soccersentimenttracker)
REQUEST_DELAY_MS=1200

# --- Reddit -----------------------------------------------------------------
# r/Ajax, r/PSV, r/Feyenoord, r/Eredivisie. This is the single richest source of
# actual fan reaction. Create a "script" app at
# https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps  (free, takes about two minutes).
# NOTE: Reddit blocks most datacenter IPs for anonymous requests, so OAuth is
# effectively mandatory when running from a VPS or cloud container.
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=

# --- YouTube ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Comments under club channels and highlight videos. Get a Data API v3 key from
# https://console.cloud.google.com/ . Free tier is 10k units/day, which is
# roughly 100 comment pages — plenty for three clubs.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=

# --- Bluesky ----------------------------------------------------------------
# The practical X/Twitter replacement: the search endpoint is public and free.
# Anonymous access works from residential IPs; from a datacenter you will need
# an app password from https://bsky.app/settings/app-passwords .
BLUESKY_IDENTIFIER=
BLUESKY_APP_PASSWORD=

# --- Claude (optional, improves accuracy) -----------------------------------
# The built-in analyzer is a Dutch football lexicon: fast, free, deterministic,
# and roughly 70-75% accurate. It cannot read sarcasm, which Dutch football
# forums run on. Setting a key enables a second pass that re-scores only the
# ambiguous documents, which is where nearly all the error lives.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
LLM_MODEL=claude-opus-5
LLM_RESCORE_LIMIT=200

# --- Alerting (optional) ----------------------------------------------------
# Fires when a club's sentiment drops sharply or sits below a floor. The payload
# carries both `text` and `content`, so a Slack or Discord incoming webhook URL
# renders it without any further configuration.
ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=
ALERT_DROP_THRESHOLD=0.25
ALERT_FLOOR=-0.35
